          "text": "Cards estimate reading and hands-on practice separately. Only published lessons are links. Planned means the article is unfinished; unpublished means content exists but is not public; unavailable means the account, version or platform lacks that entry point. Every lesson links back here at the top and bottom and offers previous, next and related lessons. A source date is the last verification date, not a claim that every platform was personally tested."
